export anchor CoffeeMenuBoardStyle:
    number: 82
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Coffee menu board
    idea: The dashboard is a café menu board on kraft paper in a wooden frame, with projects as menu items priced in percent with dotted leaders, the summary in cup sizes and the overdue count as the day’s special.
    base: light
    palette:
        wall: #efe7da, the page behind the board
        wood: #6a4528, the 16px frame, with a #4a2f1a edge
        kraft: #d8bb8d, the board surface with faint fibres
        lightKraft: #e3caa1, last week bars
        milk: #f7eedc, the order slip, tags, search and fields
        espresso: #2a180b, text, outlines and the primary button
        roast: #4f3320, script notes, dotted leaders and this week bars
        crema: #c98b3c, foam caps on the bars, decoration only
        green: #1e5a2a, On track on milk
        caramel: #7a4a00, At risk on milk
        cherry: #9e1f17, Behind, the overdue count and the special ribbon
    type:
        Three stacks. Slab caps use Rockwell, Rockwell Nova, Roboto Slab,
        Courier New, Georgia at 700, the brand 30px tracked 0.12em, section
        heads 26px tracked 0.14em, menu items 21px, prices 30px and summary
        figures 46px. Hand lettering uses Marker Felt, Ink Free, Chalkboard
        SE, Comic Sans MS for the 52px greeting and notes at 15 to 21px.
        Descriptions use Gill Sans, Trebuchet MS, Segoe UI at 15px italic.
    layout:
        The dashboard sits on a kraft board inside a 16px wood frame with a
        dark inner line. The header has a steaming cup mark with BRIGHTWORK
        and today’s project menu in script, a pill search, a dark New
        project pill, a bell with a red 3 and on shift Mara Okafor. Nav is
        centred slab caps between two espresso rules with a coffee bean
        between items and Home inverted. The greeting is centred script with
        the date in slab caps and a red ribbon reading Today’s special, 4
        tasks are overdue. Four cups of growing size show the summary
        numbers, labelled small, medium, too hot and large, the overdue cup
        red. On the menu lists the six projects as items with a dotted
        leader to the percent as a price and a description line with team,
        tasks, due and a tag. Below, Cups poured is a bar chart of rounded
        cups, light kraft last week and dark roast with crema caps this
        week. From the counter is a taped milk slip of Fresh orders with
        dark time chips, then a key of the three tags. At 375px the menu
        and counter stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 10 to 12px between menu items and 34px between menu columns.
    density: Medium. One line per item plus a description line.
    corners: Pill buttons, fields and search, 4 to 6px on tags, swatches and the board.
    borders: A 16px wood frame with a dark inner line, 2px espresso rules round the nav and dotted price leaders.
    shadows: One soft shadow under the board and one under the taped order slip, which tilts slightly.
    icons:
        Cups in four sizes and a bean between nav items. Tags on milk pair
        the word with a coffee bean for On track, a triangle for At risk and
        a square for Behind.
    focus: A 3px espresso outline offset 2px with a 6px milk halo.
    tone: A friendly barista, such as Today’s special, On the menu, Cups poured, From the counter and Fresh orders.
